    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d745">

                <pb facs="0882" n="788" sameAs="frus:frus1896/pg788"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Uhl to Mr. Williams.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-11-14"><hi rendition="#small-caps">November</hi> 14,
                            1895</date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 1180.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I inclose, with further reference to the
                    case of Julio Sanguily, a copy of a letter addressed to the Department by his
                    brother, Manuel Sanguily, in which he requests that you may be present at the
                    trial which, as you report, has been set down for the 28th of this month.</p>
                <p>You will accordingly attend the public proceedings as a spectator and make
                    concise but sufficient report thereof to this Department.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Edwin F. Uhl</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Assistant Secretary.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
